{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dd49dec22d2a45f376fab5f9b2b3850ef148ac6204b053fd9889461f9586f75f", "ja": "（百合子達のユニットによるライブが終わった。\nお客さん達の拍手は、なかなか鳴り止まなかった）", "zh": "（百合子她们的团体演唱会结束了。\n观众的掌声久久仍未停歇。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "70266974cf7d817573cd4be7668888a9313a8f026763b657787389dfb355ea5a", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nライブ、無事に終わって良かったですね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n演唱会顺利结束，真是太好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "91eed8b0c2dfe218883b77c929e4a65b4405a174b783338e27367bc89010695c", "ja": "お客さんたちの拍手の音、更衣室まで聞こえてました！\nうれしいな……えへへ♪", "zh": "观众的掌声都传到更衣室里面了！\n好高兴喔……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b9501fd723b55a5e8d8124f1ddae2b11fea351c9c22ed7fcf87d2545f67a4f56", "ja": "お疲れさま、百合子。今回のユニットが成功したのは、\n百合子が頑張ってくれたお陰だよ。お手柄だったな！", "zh": "辛苦了，百合子。这次的团体之所以会成功，\n都是多亏了百合子的努力，你功劳很大喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "97041d10d1a694ca99193fa0bddad85e0b91d34d86dbdf25e5246ba25c3b22b2", "ja": "そ、そんなこと！　私なんて、自分が考えた妄想、\nじゃなくて設定を書き散らかしただけですから！", "zh": "哪、哪有！我只是把自己的妄想──\n不对，把想到的设定随意写下来而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cb14f084dd864b9ca3426b4ce8bcfa7b89e0e27c73264b9542de06c8a54e74cf", "ja": "でも、あれがあったからこそ、みんなで\n意識のすり合わせができたんだと思う。ありがとう。", "zh": "但我觉得就是因为有了那个，\n大家才能成功取得共识，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9b60f0473f9df9e77155e998be39cf1f803a79c9ee48654f7a5e9b08fcad2742", "ja": "百合子にはアイドルだけでなく、文章でも\n感動を伝える才能があるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "百合子不只有当偶像的天分，\n或许在写作方面也拥有感动人心的才华呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "25d2652d44e96c1cb7c78ebed74f3bb03ad250b9a299cba035b87311d80b6471", "ja": "や……。", "zh": "果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1009_p", "source_sha256": "26e2943269c2a734048ba63213425e66fcf4fce71cd23cef4a7d163c35c5ff6b", "ja": "や？", "zh": "果？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "8c5573a8f316b2fb7ab689359c46fe5a4172119051f91620b7ac7e4de716d9b7", "ja": "やっぱり、そう思いますか！？　実は自分でも、\n薄々そうじゃないかって感じてたんです！", "zh": "果然你也这么想吗！？\n其实我自己隐约也觉得是不是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "a5186709e91b773eed2839d7a1a3e2e3e58529d1992481ff99e299d670e04892", "ja": "実際、一晩であれだけの量を書くのは、想像以上に\n大変でしたけど。でも、書き始めたら楽しくて……！", "zh": "虽然一个晚上要写那么多字，超乎想像地辛苦，\n但我一下笔就写得好开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "7a53098e3735d3f56ace92eefba4eb1d2bcfa7a03a6f028a4b9f308d45803786", "ja": "ユニットのみんなや{$P$}さんが\n読んでくれると思ったら、筆が止まりませんでした！", "zh": "一想到团体成员和{$P$}先生\n会看我写的东西，我的笔就停不下来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8dbaa921425ad9a8623a415911d0919d8cfc568a8eb91863e02afa815d211ec4", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか。\nうん、そうだろうな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n嗯，我想也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "3aad1549c5e220061179f45eb915d820f783e03f388b5a5f12db116c5d3b91eb", "ja": "あっ。でも、いくら文章を書くのが楽しくても、\n小説家に転向！なんてことはしませんからね？", "zh": "啊！不过，就算写文章再怎么开心，\n我也不会改行去当小说家喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "1aa8c336298bfcf6366c54348b7c1bbc47f60cc723f5e6d9fa6b31bee5974d1c", "ja": "今の私は、765プロのアイドルですし。自分の\n好きなことで貢献できて、うれしいだけですから！", "zh": "毕竟我现在是765艺能的偶像。\n能透过自己喜爱的事物做出贡献，我就很高兴了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1016_p", "source_sha256": "907dc332e954c4664ea4b501cd7743a7bc035a83fc9001e97376ac69a1624ad2", "ja": "ああ。今回のユニットや世界観に対する\n百合子の情熱は、しっかり伝わったよ。助かった！", "zh": "嗯，百合子对这次团体及世界观抱持的热情，\n我充分感受到了，真是帮了大忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "1a21e9c76ad6465d79e2d28baf158aaaf05f9572d4a0ced0594fcd937920f904", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　{$P$}さん\nにそう言ってもらえて、がんばった甲斐がありました♪", "zh": "谢谢！能听到{$P$}先生这么说，\n我的努力就值得了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "070a4ccc7c6036f15880a7101f825e03f1e50ca23ed75e5895f67cdb64e6daee", "ja": "あの～、{$P$}さん？\nこれは、お仕事とは関係ない話なんですけど……。", "zh": "那个～{$P$}先生，\n虽然这件事和工作无关……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "a0f1b19bdc2fd0e27b7a64ea2ca9f047bf48eb30c7fd7468ef99733025e9f7c3", "ja": "もしも私が次回作を書いたら……\nその時はまた、読んでもらえますか？", "zh": "假如我之后写了续作……\n到时可以再请你看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1020_p", "source_sha256": "16fffac3c57363030d3810ac57ca41abc3580020d97aaf453dafa7373e295b71", "ja": "へえ、まだ何か書きたい事があるのか？\n百合子の新作、楽しみにしてようかな。", "zh": "哦，你还有其他想写的东西吗？\n那我就来期待百合子的新作好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "ecd03bf581326c7e3e589b971b0ae6bc5eb75cf2781718c90afa7c22611b89a6", "ja": "本当ですか！？\n実は今回のお話の、スピンオフを考えていて……。", "zh": "真的吗！？\n其实我在构思这次故事的衍生作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2851bd937bc1584d3b02fbdb11d9ceeca06439f15c454a99870d5e1b7ea8a4dc", "ja": "そうなのか。でももう、\n徹夜をするのはやめてほしいけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。\n不过，我希望你不要再熬夜了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "8fd4029b4cd6abc59d43116f6cf4c8d8e37024daec7372efd5bbeaf84f5c738a", "ja": "もちろん、大丈夫です！　寝不足の顔で\nステージに立ったりはしませんから。", "zh": "这你当然可以放心！\n我不会顶着睡眠不足的脸站上舞台的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0143_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "34addd5c22651302663d6682df187031edebdece4b3f55e2552998c756201dd3", "ja": "うん、創作意欲が湧いてきました！\n私、まだまだがんばりますね♪", "zh": "嗯，我的创作欲涌现出来了！\n我会继续努力下去的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
